{
 "$comment": "Coach Maya's onboarding question graph. Order = the order asked. A node with `when` is only asked if its condition holds on earlier answers. Every question accepts a free-text answer in addition to its options. `field` maps the answer onto the Intake; other answers are kept in intake.extras. `probe: true` lets the AI coach ask up to 2 tailored follow-ups for that section. `react` = what the coach says on the next screen when an option is picked. `stage`: essentials are asked before the movement check, after_test right after it (they shape the plan), later ones are asked one at a time over the following days (Today card, after workouts, or a 'Maya has a question' notification).",
